        "role": "agent",
        "text": "",
        "question": "你希望简历上的这个项目主要展示哪方面能力，比如后端接口设计、并发处理，还是完整业务开发？",
        "area": "projectGoals",
        "questionState": "REPLACED",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:36:22.168087300Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "ASK"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 2,
        "requestId": "8b818979-42b1-4a0d-af1b-3bd67ce0175e",
        "role": "user",
        "text": "不能问生活中的问题吗",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:36:46.624095600Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": null
      },
      {
        "sequence": 3,
        "requestId": "8b818979-42b1-4a0d-af1b-3bd67ce0175e",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "当然可以问生活里的问题。刚才那个问题只是其中一个角度，并不限定话题；你提到每周时间不多，假如这个项目不只为了求职，你自己会希望它帮你解决点什么？",
        "question": "抛开求职，你平时有没有什么反复出现的小麻烦，是希望有个工具能帮你处理的？",
        "area": "interests",
        "questionState": "ANSWERED",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:36:46.624095600Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "ASK"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 4,
        "requestId": "01a0fe2a-d382-47ae-93fe-7755a9e1165f",
        "role": "user",
        "text": "我平时会散步放松，最近总忘记沿途看到的有意思的地方；每周可用时间改为三小时。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:37:10.652725100Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": null
      },
      {
        "sequence": 5,
        "requestId": "01a0fe2a-d382-47ae-93fe-7755a9e1165f",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "散步时看到有意思的地方却记不住，这个场景挺具体。另外时间改成每周三小时，我记下了。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:37:10.652725100Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "PAUSE"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 6,
        "requestId": "3485afef-eb6a-482b-8097-894bda4e0706",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "",
        "question": "当你走回某条路、想找回之前注意到的地方时，你希望它怎么帮你？比如在地图上标出来，还是到附近时提醒你？",
        "area": "interests",
        "questionState": "REPLACED",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:37:39.617561300Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "ASK"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 7,
        "requestId": "fd73f845-f5e1-4642-9bf2-5ff8bb7190ef",
        "role": "user",
        "text": "先解释一下，聊生活和找项目方向有什么关系？具体说说。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:38:27.336090100Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": null
      },
      {
        "sequence": 8,
        "requestId": "fd73f845-f5e1-4642-9bf2-5ff8bb7190ef",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "因为值得做的项目往往就长在你真实的生活里：你常散步、会忘记沿途的发现，这类场景能说明你真正想要什么，也更容易想清楚功能和取舍，比凭空想一个方向靠谱。所以刚才才从散步聊起。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:38:27.336090100Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "KEEP_PENDING"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 9,
        "requestId": "008dd58d-27fa-4066-a270-4e3b45c64f4e",
        "role": "user",
        "text": "我会经常回看照片；现在的问题是相册没按地点整理，回想时常记不起位置，得翻很久。最好能按地点找回照片。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:39:27.459747800Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": null
      },
      {
        "sequence": 10,
        "requestId": "008dd58d-27fa-4066-a270-4e3b45c64f4e",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "明白了，你的核心场景是拍下的照片没按地点整理，回想时找不到位置。按地点找回照片，确实比单纯做应用更贴近你实际的需求。",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:39:27.460745600Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": "PAUSE"
      },
      {
        "sequence": 11,
        "requestId": "756db41b-f2d5-43ac-b675-3510dbdc80be",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "",
        "question": "照片里的位置信息，你希望是直接读照片自带的定位，还是让你手动标注地点？",
        "area": "projectGoals",
        "questionState": "REPLACED",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:39:54.182148500Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
