      },
      {
        "sequence": 12,
        "requestId": "9fbb3bc1-624e-466e-9612-56260033f056",
        "role": "user",
        "text": "不知道",
        "question": null,
        "area": null,
        "questionState": null,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-11T14:40:31.505067800Z",
        "projectId": "43fa8824-90ea-4d1d-8077-7735487e7b90",
        "nextAction": null
      },
      {
        "sequence": 13,
        "requestId": "9fbb3bc1-624e-466e-9612-56260033f056",
        "role": "agent",
        "text": "没关系，这个不清楚也很正常。可以直接先用照片自带的位置信息，大多数手机拍照时都会记录地点；手动标注以后可以在没有定位时再补上。",
        "question": null,
